# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are ignored globally, and in most repositories that
# is right. Here they are the product: the plugin ships them, and the rendered
# per-host payloads carry their own copies. Re-include them at every depth.
!AGENTS.md
!**/AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!**/CLAUDE.md

# These Codex files are part of the integration, even when a user's global
# excludes treat agent configuration as machine-local.
!/.agents/
!/.agents/plugins/
!/.agents/plugins/marketplace.json
!/.codex/
!/.codex/config.toml

# Per-machine harness settings stay out, unlike the checked-in settings.json
# a payload ships.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
.pi/settings.local.json

# Scratch
/scratch/
*.log

# Go
/tstorm
/dist/

# Docs site
docs/node_modules/
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/
